{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"9977d4a9abc310ca5a52c07b9d50337de2ed232fe87d2677867de232762e89ce","ja":"茜ちゃんを探せ！","zh":"寻找小茜！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d6e64aeff52c0090e35c0bf5efcdc989a87c48ec458702e509151f4bcc0606a1","ja":"ここにもいないみたいですね……。","zh":"这里好像也不在呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"15c8e93f40fb6e84f9b223e775f7217a3c4127d27dcc0a14d70dfaeca3f508f0","ja":"あら、朋花ちゃん、星梨花ちゃん。\nどうしたの？","zh":"哎呀，朋花、星梨花。\n怎么了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a71acbb2873b774d59212424a59b6e20941e9f1b24cfc2f8aa1199c9c7cbf7ca","ja":"茜さんを探してまして～。\nこのみさんは見かけませんでしたか～？","zh":"我正在找茜小姐～。\n请问这个美小姐有看到她吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"db26e030d65d2acac694ad4641969b6f3eb07a2979c7ac80af3df75400ce2d6e","ja":"茜ちゃんなら、●●●●プロデューサーが\nお仕事に使う雑貨なんかを買いに行ったわよ。","zh":"要是找小茜的话，●●●●制作人\n去买工作要用的杂货之类的东西了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bf993b8d82df94f4ce25abbe6483fcab924bfc32a9a78c925d90915a2a4667ec","ja":"茜ちゃんに何か用事なの？","zh":"找小茜有什么事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"78e354b8a7022ac425a02bf5a61d94cecec2c6e82361e36fbef890b542ac376f","ja":"実は茜さん、今回の公演が終わってから\nすっかり気が緩んでいるみたいでして～。","zh":"其实茜在这次公演结束之后，\n好像就彻底松懈下来了呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cbd931a02f5a4e334477b8dd5081efc8b4a9b90268d53b5482357aa017675a28","ja":"レッスンをサボったりして、\n衣装も少しキツくなってきているみたいなんです～。","zh":"经常翘课偷懒，\n连演出服好像都变得有点紧了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2181a4b250793f6ec7f8c9edfbe0fbf76085910a88b531a686dd42cad5db9592","ja":"それで一緒に特訓しようとしたのですが、\n隙を見て逃げられてしまいまして～。","zh":"于是我想着一起去特训，\n结果却被对方找机会溜掉了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"81790addb06f53ef1e2d141f408982de9e1217d9f2e1258d9f4f2bec9f49c7c2","ja":"だから、自分から買い物に行くって\n言い出したのね。茜ちゃんったら……。","zh":"怪不得会自己主动提出\n要去买东西呢。小茜真是的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"14508249bbfa57f47506ce79e7a6475f2409b61009f8addd546c47171c600b2c","ja":"早く捕まえて、\n気を引き締め直したいのですが～。","zh":"希望能早点抓住它，\n好重新打起精神来呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1422.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7746bf58ba175ac18044ad5a378928437d1ec0624035678e0358b7d03028d8c7","ja":"なるほど、事情はわかったわ！\nここは、このみお姉さんに任せなさい！","zh":"原来如此，情况我都清楚了！\n这里就交给木实大姐姐吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
